<title>SPAIN: Spain's Renfe had 50 bln pta syndicated loans.</title>
<headline>Spain's Renfe had 50 bln pta syndicated loans.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's railway Renfe said on Monday it had received a 10-year syndicated loan for 50 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>The statement added that the loan was given at a flexible rate at Mibor plus 0.05 percent for the first three years.</p>
<p>The loan is intended to cover Renfe's financial requirement for 1997, the statement added.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
